sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pg as Page
    participant IC as Incident commander
    participant Ops as Operations
    participant Comms as Comms
    participant Sys as System
    Pg->>IC: SLO burning, symptom attached
    IC->>IC: declare severity, take command
    IC->>Ops: one owner per workstream
    Ops->>Sys: gather evidence — what changed, what saturated
    Sys-->>Ops: signals
    Ops->>IC: hypothesis with the evidence behind it
    IC->>Ops: mitigate — roll back, shift traffic, or shed
    Ops->>Sys: apply
    Sys-->>IC: symptom receding
    IC->>Comms: status out on a fixed cadence
    IC->>IC: stand down, schedule the postmortem
    Note over IC: the commander coordinates and does not type — that is the rule that shortens incidents
